      "created_at": "2015-04-16T20:32:24.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I know it's old news that Revo Corp takes Plague Rat into custody following his first defeat, but I marked spoilers just in case. &nbsp;I just wanted to point out that I (and I'm sure everyone else if I noticed it&nbsp; <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/stuck_out_tongue.png?v=9\" title=\":stuck_out_tongue:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":stuck_out_tongue:\"> ) noticed that when you defeat Plague Rat in the video game, you can see the Revo Corp logo on the manacles in which he is being held. &nbsp;I thought that was a really cool touch.</p>",
