      "raw": "[quote=\"Chrono\"]\n\nI thought Baron Blade ran the medical testing that gave Setback his powers. Does he own or work for this evil corporation?\n\n[/quote]\n\nPersonally, I think that they just follow the money. &nbsp;We know Baron Blade is definately involved in RevoCorp though as RevoCorp tech is seen on Rebuilt to Survive in Fright Train&#39;s deck (and Blade provides the card quote) and the Villains blog for Plague Rat mentions that RevoCorp sent him out to hunt down Setback after he escaped from their lab.\n",
