      "created_at": "2015-05-02T05:11:48.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The thing is that we know that the owner of RevoCorp is Revenant, this leaves 3 possibilities:</p><ol>\n<li>RevoCorp is a dummy corporation really lead by Baron Blade. - Unlikely as I recall RevoCorp being mentioned as having goverment contracts and the government should do research into all companies it has contracts with to avoid this situation.</li>\n<li>RevoCorp does work for anyone who has the money. - Possible</li>\n<li>Baron Blade works for RevoCorp. - Again possible.</li>\n</ol>",
